---
import BaseLayout from './BaseLayout.astro';
import ProjectVisual from '../components/ProjectVisual.astro';

interface Props {
  title: string;
  eyebrow: string;
  description: string;
  statement: string;
  github: string;
  install: string;
  tags: string[];
  visual: 'writing' | 'video';
}

const { title, eyebrow, description, statement, github, install, tags, visual } = Astro.props;
const isWriting = visual === 'writing';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} active="projects" article>
  <div class="project-background" slot="background"></div>
  <article class:list={['project-page', `project-${visual}`]}>
    <header class="project-hero wide">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <a class="back" href="/projects/">← 返回全部沉淀</a>
        <div class="eyebrow">{eyebrow}</div>
        <h1 class="display">{title}</h1>
        <p>{statement}</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="primary-action" href={github} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a>
          <a class="secondary-action" href="#story">了解它为什么存在 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual">
        <ProjectVisual type={visual} priority />
      </div>
    </header>

    {
      isWriting ? (
        <>
          <section id="story" class="story-section wide">
            <div class="section-label">01 · 问题</div>
            <div class="story-heading">
              <h2 class="display">大家都闻得到 AI 味。<br />但它究竟从哪里来？</h2>
              <p>
                问题不只是“大词太多”或“喜欢排比”。更深的一层，是模型常拿英文句法组织中文：
                动词藏进名词后面，抽象判断走在事实前面，句子看起来正式，意思却越来越远。
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="sentence-lab" data-sentence-lab>
              <div class="lab-toolbar" role="tablist" aria-label="句子对照">
                <button class="active" type="button" data-mode="diagnose">查看病灶</button>
                <button type="button" data-mode="rewrite">看改写</button>
              </div>
              <div class="lab-stage diagnose-stage">
                <p>
                  本次升级<span data-note="空壳句式">不仅仅是</span>一次简单的迭代，更是我们对整个
                  <span data-note="抽象大词">底层逻辑</span>的一次
                  <span data-note="名词化">系统性重塑</span>。
                </p>
                <div class="lab-notes">
                  <span>动作被藏起来</span>
                  <span>抽象词替代事实</span>
                  <span>用姿态代替判断</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="lab-stage rewrite-stage" hidden>
                <p>这次不只是改了几个功能。我们重新理了一遍底层逻辑。</p>
                <span>信息没有减少，句子的着力点回到了动作和事实。</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="source-section">
            <div class="wide source-inner">
              <div class="section-label">02 · 来源</div>
              <div class="source-intro">
                <h2 class="display">这不是一份“AI 写作技巧”清单。</h2>
                <p>它把一百年来对欧化中文的研究，转成了 Agent 能执行的规则。</p>
              </div>
              <div class="source-timeline">
                <div><time>1943</time><strong>王力</strong><span>《中国现代语法》中的“欧化的语法”</span></div>
                <div><time>1972</time><strong>思果</strong><span>从翻译实践总结中文的常见病</span></div>
                <div><time>1987</time><strong>余光中</strong><span>《怎样改进英式中文？》</span></div>
                <div class="current"><time>现在</time><strong>好好说话</strong><span>把历史诊断变成可重复执行的工作流</span></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="method-section wide">
            <div class="section-label">03 · 工作方式</div>
            <h2 class="display">先守住事实，再处理表达。</h2>
            <div class="method-flow">
              <div><span>01</span><strong>保护事实</strong><p>数字、术语、链接和引用原文不能被润色改变。</p></div>
              <div><span>02</span><strong>识别病灶</strong><p>找到翻译腔、名词化、空泛拔高和自造词。</p></div>
              <div><span>03</span><strong>重写句子</strong><p>让动词回来，让具体事实走在抽象判断前面。</p></div>
              <div><span>04</span><strong>交付前回读</strong><p>检查事实、气口和作者原本的声音是否还在。</p></div>
            </div>
          </section>
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          <section id="story" class="story-section wide">
            <div class="section-label">01 · 能力缺口</div>
            <div class="story-heading">
              <h2 class="display">模型看得见图片，<br />却看不见事情如何发生。</h2>
              <p>
                很多 App 问题只存在于一段动态过程里。均匀抽帧会留下大量重复画面，
                真正出问题的瞬间反而可能一次都没被选中。
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="frame-demo">
              <div class="frame-before">
                <span>均匀抽帧</span>
                <div class="frames">
                  <i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i>
                </div>
                <p>六张几乎相同的画面，问题发生的 11.2 秒不在里面。</p>
              </div>
              <div class="frame-after">
                <span>运动区间</span>
                <div class="motion-window">
                  <i></i><i></i><i class="key"></i><i></i>
                </div>
                <p>先找变化，再让模型只看真正有信息的瞬间。</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="pipeline-section">
            <div class="wide">
              <div class="section-label">02 · 方法</div>
              <div class="pipeline-heading">
                <h2 class="display">不是看更多，<br />而是先选对。</h2>
                <div class="zero-token"><strong>0</strong><span>token 用于选择关键帧</span></div>
              </div>
              <div class="pipeline">
                <div><span>01</span><strong>Grid</strong><p>先看完整视频的节奏</p></div>
                <div><span>02</span><strong>Scan</strong><p>用帧差定位运动区间</p></div>
                <div><span>03</span><strong>Zoom</strong><p>放大可疑的几秒</p></div>
                <div><span>04</span><strong>Judge</strong><p>让模型理解发生了什么</p></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="evidence-section wide">
            <div class="section-label">03 · 一次真实诊断</div>
            <h2 class="display">结论落到具体时间，<br />而不是“视频里好像有问题”。</h2>
            <div class="evidence-timeline">
              <div><time>00:09.0</time><span>开始滚动</span></div>
              <div><time>00:11.2</time><span>手指停止</span></div>
              <div class="anomaly"><time>00:11.8</time><span>面板仍继续移动</span></div>
              <div class="conclusion"><strong>结论</strong><span>交互状态异常，不是视频卡顿。</span></div>
            </div>
          </section>
        </>
      )
    }

    <section class="details-section">
      <div class="details-inner wide">
        <aside>
          <div class="section-label">04 · 使用与边界</div>
          <div class="project-facts">
            <div><span>TYPE</span><strong>Agent Skill</strong></div>
            <div><span>FOCUS</span><strong>{tags.join(' / ')}</strong></div>
            <div><span>INSTALL</span><code>{install}</code></div>
          </div>
        </aside>
        <div class="project-prose">
          <slot />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="project-footer wide">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Open Source</div>
        <h2 class="display">源码、安装说明和后续更新都在 GitHub。</h2>
      </div>
      <a href={github} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">打开仓库 <span>↗</span></a>
    </footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  const lab = document.querySelector('[data-sentence-lab]');
  if (lab) {
    const buttons = Array.from(lab.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-mode]'));
    const diagnose = lab.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.diagnose-stage');
    const rewrite = lab.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.rewrite-stage');
    buttons.forEach((button) => {
      button.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const mode = button.dataset.mode;
        buttons.forEach((item) => item.classList.toggle('active', item === button));
        if (diagnose) diagnose.hidden = mode !== 'diagnose';
        if (rewrite) rewrite.hidden = mode !== 'rewrite';
      });
    });
  }

  document.querySelectorAll('.project-prose pre').forEach((pre) => {
    const btn = document.createElement('button');
    btn.className = 'copy-btn';
    btn.type = 'button';
    btn.textContent = '复制';
    btn.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      const code = pre.querySelector('code')?.textContent ?? pre.textContent ?? '';
      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(code);
        btn.textContent = '已复制';
        setTimeout(() => (btn.textContent = '复制'), 1600);
      } catch {
        btn.textContent = '复制失败';
      }
    });
    pre.appendChild(btn);
  });
</script>

<style is:global>
  .project-background {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    background: #030303;
  }

  .project-page {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .project-hero {
    display: grid;
    min-height: calc(88svh - 52px);
    padding-block: 70px;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(360px, 0.76fr) minmax(0, 1.24fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: 28px;
  }

  .hero-copy {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .back {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 72px;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-size: 13px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .back:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .hero-copy h1 {
    margin: 18px 0 26px;
    font-size: clamp(58px, 8vw, 104px);
    line-height: 0.98;
  }

  .hero-copy > p {
    max-width: 550px;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    margin-top: 36px;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .primary-action,
  .secondary-action {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 0 18px;
    align-items: center;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-size: 12px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .primary-action {
    border-color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--bg);
  }

  .primary-action:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  .secondary-action {
    color: var(--ink-dim);
  }

  .secondary-action:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .hero-visual {
    min-width: 0;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 2;
  }

  .hero-visual .project-visual {
    height: 100%;
  }

  .story-section,
  .method-section,
  .evidence-section {
    padding-block: 130px;
  }

  .section-label {
    color: var(--accent);
    font: 10px var(--mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .story-heading {
    display: grid;
    margin-top: 34px;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 0.7fr;
    align-items: end;
    gap: 70px;
  }

  .story-heading h2,
  .source-intro h2,
  .method-section > h2,
  .pipeline-heading h2,
  .evidence-section > h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 65px);
    line-height: 1.28;
  }

  .story-heading p,
  .source-intro p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .sentence-lab {
    margin-top: 90px;
    border-block: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .lab-toolbar {
    display: flex;
    padding: 18px 0;
    gap: 8px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .lab-toolbar button {
    padding: 7px 12px;
    border: 0;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .lab-toolbar button.active {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .lab-stage {
    min-height: 360px;
    padding: 68px 0;
  }

  .lab-stage[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .lab-stage > p {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 48px);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .diagnose-stage [data-note] {
    position: relative;
    color: var(--accent);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(245, 185, 113, 0.6);
  }

  .diagnose-stage [data-note]::after {
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    bottom: -19px;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    content: attr(data-note);
    font: 8px var(--mono);
  }

  .lab-notes {
    display: flex;
    margin-top: 72px;
    gap: 34px;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .lab-notes span::before {
    margin-right: 8px;
    color: var(--accent);
    content: "·";
  }

  .rewrite-stage > span {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 42px;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .source-section,
  .pipeline-section,
  .details-section {
    border-block: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.012);
  }

  .source-inner,
  .pipeline-section > .wide {
    padding-block: 130px;
  }

  .source-intro {
    display: grid;
    margin-top: 34px;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.62fr;
    align-items: end;
    gap: 70px;
  }

  .source-timeline {
    display: grid;
    margin-top: 92px;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .source-timeline > div {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 175px;
    padding: 30px 24px 0 0;
  }

  .source-timeline > div::before {
    position: absolute;
    top: -4px;
    left: 0;
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--ink-faint);
    content: "";
  }

  .source-timeline .current::before {
    background: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(245, 185, 113, 0.45);
  }

  .source-timeline time {
    color: var(--accent);
    font: 10px var(--mono);
  }

  .source-timeline strong {
    display: block;
    margin: 9px 0 6px;
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .source-timeline span {
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .method-section > h2 {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin-top: 34px;
  }

  .method-flow,
  .pipeline {
    display: grid;
    margin-top: 88px;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .method-flow > div,
  .pipeline > div {
    min-height: 210px;
    padding: 28px 28px 0 0;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .method-flow > div:last-child,
  .pipeline > div:last-child {
    border-right: 0;
  }

  .method-flow span,
  .pipeline span {
    color: var(--accent);
    font: 9px var(--mono);
  }

  .method-flow strong,
  .pipeline strong {
    display: block;
    margin: 48px 0 10px;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .method-flow p,
  .pipeline p {
    max-width: 220px;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .frame-demo {
    display: grid;
    margin-top: 90px;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--line);
  }

  .frame-before,
  .frame-after {
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 38px;
    background: #050505;
  }

  .frame-before > span,
  .frame-after > span {
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font: 10px var(--mono);
  }

  .frames,
  .motion-window {
    display: grid;
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 42px 0 28px;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .motion-window {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  }

  .frames i,
  .motion-window i {
    aspect-ratio: 9 / 14;
    border: 1px solid rgba(153, 193, 207, 0.13);
    background:
      linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)) 12% 13% / 76% 7% no-repeat,
      repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) 0 1px, transparent 1px 18%) 12% 35% / 76% 54% no-repeat,
      #090b0c;
    opacity: 0.4;
  }

  .motion-window i {
    opacity: 0.74;
  }

  .motion-window i.key {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    opacity: 1;
    box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(245, 185, 113, 0.08);
  }

  .frame-before p,
  .frame-after p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .pipeline-heading {
    display: flex;
    margin-top: 34px;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: end;
    gap: 60px;
  }

  .zero-token {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 12px;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .zero-token strong {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 90px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 0.8;
  }

  .zero-token span {
    max-width: 90px;
    font: 9px/1.5 var(--mono);
  }

  .evidence-section > h2 {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-top: 34px;
  }

  .evidence-timeline {
    display: grid;
    margin-top: 90px;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr 1.4fr;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .evidence-timeline > div {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 150px;
    padding: 30px 24px 0 0;
  }

  .evidence-timeline > div::before {
    position: absolute;
    top: -4px;
    left: 0;
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--ink-faint);
    content: "";
  }

  .evidence-timeline .anomaly::before {
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  .evidence-timeline time,
  .evidence-timeline strong {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    color: var(--accent);
    font: 11px var(--mono);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .evidence-timeline span {
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .evidence-timeline .conclusion {
    padding-left: 28px;
    border-left: 1px solid rgba(245, 185, 113, 0.34);
  }

  .evidence-timeline .conclusion::before {
    display: none;
  }

  .details-inner {
    display: grid;
    min-width: 0;
    padding-block: 130px;
    grid-template-columns: 260px minmax(0, 760px);
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 90px;
  }

  .details-inner > * {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .project-facts {
    display: grid;
    margin-top: 52px;
    gap: 28px;
  }

  .project-facts > div {
    display: grid;
    gap: 7px;
  }

  .project-facts span {
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font: 8px var(--mono);
  }

  .project-facts strong,
  .project-facts code {
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    font: 11px/1.7 var(--mono);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .project-prose {
    min-width: 0;
    max-width: 100%;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    color: #c5c3bf;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.95;
  }

  .project-prose h2 {
    margin: 78px 0 24px;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 31px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .project-prose h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .project-prose p {
    margin: 0 0 28px;
  }

  .project-prose strong {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .project-prose ul,
  .project-prose ol {
    margin: 0 0 30px;
    padding-left: 1.35em;
  }

  .project-prose li {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .project-prose blockquote {
    margin: 36px 0;
    padding-left: 24px;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--accent);
    color: var(--ink-dim);
  }

  .project-prose code {
    padding: 2px 6px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    color: var(--ink);
    font: 0.88em var(--mono);
  }

  .project-prose pre {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 100%;
    margin: 34px 0;
    padding: 22px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: #070707;
  }

  .project-prose pre code {
    padding: 0;
    background: none;
  }

  .copy-btn {
    position: absolute;
    top: 10px;
    right: 10px;
    padding: 4px 9px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: #050505;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    font: 10px var(--mono);
    cursor: pointer;
  }

